message: "If you use this workflow, please cite this software release and the associated publication when available."
title: "Brassica napus homoeolog expression bias workflow"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-07
authors:
  - family-names: "Rodrigues-Silva"
    given-names: "Paolo Lucas"
repository-code: "https://github.com/paolo-lucas/Bnapus-homeolog-expression-bias"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23210373"
license: "GPL-3.0-only"
abstract: "Reproducible workflow for identifying BnA-BnC reciprocal best-hit homoeologous gene pairs in Brassica napus cv. Darmor-bzh v10 and analyzing subgenome-specific expression, homoeolog expression bias, transcriptomic dosage, and bias transitions from TPM-normalized RNA-seq data."
keywords:
  - "Brassica napus"
  - "homoeolog expression bias"
  - "subgenome expression"
  - "reciprocal best hit"
  - "RBH"
  - "RNA-seq"
  - "TPM"
  - "priming"
